 "failures_and_caveats": [
  "GRADUATE-SUPPLY VERDICT: the absolute-income discriminator fails (E13b; independent B1 replication shows the sigma=0.5 firing corner is numerically unstable), but after level-matching (E13c) the formal-employment-probability claim survives: surplus -0.1511 vs rival +0.0085/+0.0095/-0.0054 at sigma 0.5/1/2. Claim formal access only, and label it simulation-only.",
  "DOUBLE REDUCTION VERDICT: E18's additive/universal support raises paid tutoring (+18%), but E18b gives substitution a demand channel and paid spend falls sharply (C1 -1291.5, C3 -341.4, C4 -1241.2 vs ban-only; completion higher). C10 is WITHDRAWN. The direction is set by the substitution elasticity between school support and commercial tutoring, which is unmeasured. Not a measured Double Reduction effect either way.",
  "FLOOR/RACE: at 4 reps the floor's own contribution to persistence holding ranking fixed is at seed noise (|delta| <= 0.002); ranking produces intensification (ranked -0.039/-0.064/-0.049; unranked +0.151/+0.036/+0.630). Allocation-rule knockout (B3) is mixed: only the lottery arm is distinguishable.",
  "LONG RUN: batch B4 shows the endogenous trajectory does not generate the massification rise (entry 0.404 -> 0.020; smoothed 0.218 -> 0.108); EXO is input-driven. Matches the floorworld audit warning.",
  "INFORMATION: B5 detailed reader dominates coarse/skill/eligibility on error (0.045 vs 0.411) but the predeclared rising-certification-demand half-claim is contradicted; foreign-recognition sign is a declared parameter artifact.",
  "COUNTRY: E19 default (uncalibrated) Philippine model misses the manuscript's own targets (basic->college 0.227 vs ~0.70; GPI 0.868 vs 1.2-1.3); no Hong Kong series was loaded (DATA BLOCKED); transfer result is model-to-model and null.",
  "E3 borrow is a quantity, not a price; no interest rate modelled. E10 omega, E18/E18b school support, and B4/E12 trajectories are NEW extension modules, not part of the delivered model.",
  "E14/E15 and E19/E20 use pilot-strength reps (3 x N=2000; 2 x N=5000).",
  "The massification_project snapshot has no VCS metadata; provenance is the parent Atlas checkout at 02cade9 plus file hashes. public actor-runs.csv (8-seed mean) is not the manuscript's 30-replication median run.",
  "The iCloud venv eviction forced a fresh local venv (pandas 3.1.1 vs prior 2.3.3).",
  "The synthetic council panelists are AI composites grounded in published literature; nothing is a statement by a living scholar.",
  "No result in this package is causal evidence about any country. All model outputs are simulated. UIS 1980-2020 panel includes imputed cells (04_data/IMPUTATION_METHOD.md); imputed cells must not be cited as observations."
 ],
